{
  "slug": "humanize-kit",
  "name": "Humanize Kit",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "AI pattern interrupter for Claude. Three skills that build a voice fingerprint from your real writing, then rewrite AI output to match it. /voice-profiler interviews you and analyzes 3-5 writing samples to generate a structured profile (sentence rhythm, vocabulary, openings, closings, banned words). /humanize scores any AI-generated text against 23 detection patterns across three tiers (statistical, deep-learning, document-level) and rewrites in your authentic voice using the saved profile. /humanize-ig does the same with Instagram-specific overrides (lowercase, no em dashes, abbreviated phrasing). Free + MIT. Dual-target SKILL.md — works on Claude Code (plugin install) and Claude.ai Cowork (paste GitHub URL or .zip upload).",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills** and **1 hook**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `humanize` (AI pattern interrupter — rewrites AI-generated text to break the statistical patterns detectors (Pangram, GPTZero, Copyleaks) key on,…), `humanize-ig` (Rewrites text for Instagram captions — compact, lowercase, imperfect grammar, no em dashes, abbreviated phrasing), `voice-profiler` (Interactive writing voice profiler — interviews you about your writing style and analyzes your real writing samples to…)\n- **Hooks** (1): `SessionStart`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install humanize-kit@claude-community` from `Branded-Mayhem-Collective-LLC/humanize-kit`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 3,
    "hook": 1
  },
